  "details": "As someone who recently started making world together with some friends it'd be really nice to have organizations close to what Github has.\nThe general idea i've come up with so far:\n1. You create a organization.\n2. You invite your friend's VRC account to that organization.\n3. Now you and your friend can both push to that organization account from your own VRC account.\nI believe this would make the process of working together with other world creators quite a lot easier, especially because you won't have to create a new VRC group account, level that account and then share the login details with everyone in the group. Instead you can just push from your own VRC account. \nMaybe we can even add showing the worlds uploaded to the organization on the individual's VRC account.",
